{"seq":3,"slug":"backtesting-and-pitfalls","title":"回测与陷阱：为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/backtesting-and-pitfalls","wordCount":2339,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"回测与陷阱-为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象\">回测与陷阱：为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象</h1><p>一条年化 30%、最大回撤只有 8% 的资金曲线，在配置流程的实施环节几乎是危险信号而非卖点。Quantopian 平台上 888 个真实算法策略的大样本研究给出了冰冷的结论：样本内的夏普比率对样本外结果的预测力低到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.025</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2 &lt; 0.025</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.025</span></span></span></span></span>，而且回测做得越久、参数搜得越多的策略，样本内外的差距反而越大——这正是过拟合的指纹（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0950705124011110\">de Prado 等, Quantopian 研究</a>）。资产配置的回测之所以特别脆弱，是因为它把&quot;估计协方差矩阵 + 求解最优权重 + 周期性再平衡&quot;三层模型串在一起，每一层都会把历史的噪声当成可投资的信号放大。本文要讲的，是这些放大器藏在哪里，以及如何在权重真正进入实盘前把它们关掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把回测当作一次统计实验\">核心概念：把回测当作一次统计实验</h2><p>回测不是&quot;如果当年这么做会赚多少&quot;的怀旧，而是对一个统计假设的检验：这套配置规则在未来未见过的数据上，是否仍有正的风险调整后收益。一旦如此定位，所有陷阱都可以归到两个正交的维度——<strong>统计可靠性</strong>（这个夏普是真信号还是搜出来的）和<strong>实现可靠性</strong>（同样的权重换个撮合引擎、加上真实成本后还成立吗）。2026 年 arXiv 上一篇专门量化&quot;实现风险&quot;的论文强调，这两者互不替代：一个策略即使通过了去通胀夏普比率（deflated Sharpe ratio）的多重检验校正，换个回测引擎仍可能跑出完全不同的盈亏；反过来，多引擎结果完全一致也丝毫不能保证它没有样本内过拟合（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2603.20319\">arXiv:2603.20319</a>）。</p>\n<p>下图把一次诚实回测的数据流和它对应的陷阱关口画出来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始历史数据] --&gt; B{时点正确?&lt;br/&gt;point-in-time}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| X1[前视偏差&lt;br/&gt;look-ahead bias]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{含已退市/失败资产?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| X2[幸存者偏差&lt;br/&gt;survivorship bias]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[样本内训练&lt;br/&gt;估计协方差/权重]&#10;  D --&gt; E{多重测试校正?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| X3[回测过拟合&lt;br/&gt;夏普被多次试验夸大]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[样本外/前向验证]&#10;  F --&gt; G{加交易成本&lt;br/&gt;滑点/冲击?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| X4[纸面收益&lt;br/&gt;无法落地]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[可上线的配置规则]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始历史数据] --&gt; B{时点正确?&lt;br/&gt;point-in-time}\n  B --&gt;|否| X1[前视偏差&lt;br/&gt;look-ahead bias]\n  B --&gt;|是| C{含已退市/失败资产?}\n  C --&gt;|否| X2[幸存者偏差&lt;br/&gt;survivorship bias]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[样本内训练&lt;br/&gt;估计协方差/权重]\n  D --&gt; E{多重测试校正?}\n  E --&gt;|否| X3[回测过拟合&lt;br/&gt;夏普被多次试验夸大]\n  E --&gt;|是| F[样本外/前向验证]\n  F --&gt; G{加交易成本&lt;br/&gt;滑点/冲击?}\n  G --&gt;|否| X4[纸面收益&lt;br/&gt;无法落地]\n  G --&gt;|是| H[可上线的配置规则]</pre><p>下表把四类最致命的偏差与它们在配置实施中的典型触发点对齐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>配置实施中的典型触发点</th>\n<th>量级证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前视偏差</td>\n<td>用了当时尚未公布的数据</td>\n<td>用全样本计算波动率/分位数；财报用公告日而非可得日</td>\n<td>全样本 VRP 分位数会虚增夏普 15–30%（<a href=\"https://dev.to/tomasz_dobrowolski_35d32c/look-ahead-bias-in-volatility-backtests-why-most-vrp-percentiles-silently-cheat-and-how-to-fix-4jg0\">dev.to 实测</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幸存者偏差</td>\n<td>样本只含活到今天的资产</td>\n<td>用当前指数成分回溯历史</td>\n<td>系统性高估收益、低估尾部风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回测过拟合</td>\n<td>反复调参直到曲线好看</td>\n<td>在同一份历史上网格搜索再平衡频率/约束</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.025</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2 &lt; 0.025</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.025</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本外预测力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本忽略</td>\n<td>假设零摩擦成交</td>\n<td>高换手最优组合、低流动性资产再平衡</td>\n<td>高换手策略落地后常由正转负</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前视偏差-最隐蔽因为它-看起来很合理\">前视偏差：最隐蔽因为它&quot;看起来很合理&quot;</h2><p>前视偏差的危险在于它从不报错。代码能跑、曲线漂亮，只是悄悄用了未来。最常见的形态不是直接读未来价格，而是用<strong>整段历史</strong>去计算一个本该滚动估计的统计量。一个 2026 年的实证案例直击要害：绝大多数已发表的波动率回测，把方差风险溢价（VRP）的分位数对着完整数据集计算，于是 2018 年的某天就&quot;知道&quot;了自己在未来五年分布里的位置；换成只用截至当日数据的前向分位数后，夏普比率的差异可达 15–30%（<a href=\"https://dev.to/tomasz_dobrowolski_35d32c/look-ahead-bias-in-volatility-backtests-why-most-vrp-percentiles-silently-cheat-and-how-to-fix-4jg0\">Look-Ahead Bias in Volatility Backtests</a>）。</p>\n<p>在资产配置里，这类泄漏的高发区有三处：用全样本均值方差估计协方差矩阵、用调整后的复权价格序列（已含未来拆股/分红信息）、以及基本面因子用财报&quot;报告期&quot;而非&quot;市场可得日&quot;对齐。防御的唯一可靠办法是采用<strong>时点数据（point-in-time）</strong>——只让模型看到决策时刻真实可得的信息（<a href=\"https://sharpely.in/blog/bias-free-backtesting-explained:-how-sharpely-uses-point-in-time-data-to-avoid-look-ahead-and-survivorship-bias\">sharpely 时点数据实践</a>）。一个实用自检：把任何统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1079em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的计算窗口写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t-w,\\ t]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,\\ T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，若公式里出现了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（样本末端），几乎必然有前视。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回测过拟合-多重试验如何凭空制造夏普\">回测过拟合：多重试验如何凭空制造夏普</h2><p>如果在同一份历史上尝试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个策略变体，仅靠运气，最佳变体的夏普期望就会随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 上升。去通胀夏普比率正是为此设计：它按试验次数、收益序列的偏度与峰度，调高夏普&quot;显著&quot;所需的门槛，把多重测试的红利扣回去（<a href=\"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/deflated-sharpe.pdf\">Deflated Sharpe Ratio, Bailey &amp; de Prado</a>）。与之配套的概率指标是<strong>回测过拟合概率（PBO）</strong>——通过组合对称交叉验证（CSCV），估计&quot;样本内最优的配置在样本外跑进下半区&quot;的概率（<a href=\"https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=2326253\">The Probability of Backtest Overfitting</a>）。</p>\n<p>直觉公式：在零信号假设下，做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立试验后期望最大夏普约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\max SR_N] \\approx \\sqrt{\\frac{2\\ln N}{T}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7634em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6766em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6366em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7634em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是样本长度（年）。它说明一件反直觉的事：试验越多，需要越高的实际夏普才能压过纯噪声的最大值。所以&quot;我试了 200 组参数选了最好的&quot;恰恰让证据更弱而非更强。</p>\n<p>针对配置/机器学习类策略，2024–2026 年的共识方法是 López de Prado 的<strong>组合净化交叉验证（CPCV）</strong>。它在 K 折基础上做两件事：净化（purging，剔除训练集中可能向测试集泄漏信息的相邻样本）与禁运（embargo，在测试折前后留缓冲带），再以组合方式生成多条样本外路径，从而直接产出 PBO 分布。多项对比研究显示 CPCV 在更低的 PBO 与更优的去通胀夏普统计量上明显胜过传统留出法（<a href=\"https://www.scribd.com/document/725401650/SSRN-id4778909\">CPCV insights, SSRN</a>；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purged_cross-validation\">Purged cross-validation, Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前向验证-让历史-按它本来的样子-展开\">前向验证：让历史&quot;按它本来的样子&quot;展开</h2><p>留出法（in-sample / out-of-sample 一刀切）在金融回测里被反复证明不可靠，因为单一的样本外段落同样可以被反复偷看到拟合。更贴近实盘的范式是<strong>前向验证（walk-forward）</strong>：沿时间轴一步步前进，每个再平衡时点只用截至当时的信息估计参数、定权重，然后把组合持有到下一个再平衡日，如此滚动（<a href=\"https://www.fortraders.com/blog/how-to-avoid-bias-in-backtesting\">fortraders, walk-forward</a>）。它天然杜绝前视，并且通过在扩展窗或滚动窗上反复重估，让你看到信号在前向期的<strong>衰减曲线</strong>——这是判断&quot;这套配置是否会随时间失效&quot;的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W1[窗口1 训练: 2018-2020] --&gt; T1[测试: 2021]&#10;  W2[窗口2 训练: 2018-2021] --&gt; T2[测试: 2022]&#10;  W3[窗口3 训练: 2018-2022] --&gt; T3[测试: 2023]&#10;  T1 --&gt; R[拼接前向收益&lt;br/&gt;观察夏普衰减]&#10;  T2 --&gt; R&#10;  T3 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; D{衰减可接受?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| L[纳入候选配置]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| K[拒绝/重新设计]\">graph TD\n  W1[窗口1 训练: 2018-2020] --&gt; T1[测试: 2021]\n  W2[窗口2 训练: 2018-2021] --&gt; T2[测试: 2022]\n  W3[窗口3 训练: 2018-2022] --&gt; T3[测试: 2023]\n  T1 --&gt; R[拼接前向收益&lt;br/&gt;观察夏普衰减]\n  T2 --&gt; R\n  T3 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; D{衰减可接受?}\n  D --&gt;|是| L[纳入候选配置]\n  D --&gt;|否| K[拒绝/重新设计]</pre><p>扩展窗（expanding）适合参数随数据增长应更稳的模型；滚动窗（rolling）适合市场状态会切换、旧数据可能误导的场景。无论哪种，最终评价都要落在<strong>拼接后的前向收益序列</strong>上，而不是任何单个测试段的峰值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幸存者偏差与成本-把纸面收益拉回地面\">幸存者偏差与成本：把纸面收益拉回地面</h2><p>幸存者偏差源于一个再自然不过的动作：用今天的指数成分股去回溯十年。那些退市、破产、被并购的公司被悄悄抹去，于是历史里只剩下赢家，收益被系统性高估、尾部风险被系统性低估。唯一的修法是数据集同时纳入已失败与已退市的资产，并用时点成分表还原每个历史时刻真实的可投资域（<a href=\"https://analystprep.com/study-notes/cfa-level-2/problems-in-backtesting/\">analystprep, biases in backtesting</a>）。</p>\n<p>成本则是把&quot;纸面最优&quot;打回原形的最后一道关。均值方差优化天然偏好高换手、押注极端权重的解，而再平衡的每一次买卖都要付出价差、佣金、以及随成交量上升的市场冲击成本。一个未扣成本时夏普亮眼的高换手配置，扣除现实摩擦后常由正转负。实务上有两条防线：在优化目标里直接加入换手惩罚项</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_w\\ \\ w^\\top \\mu - \\frac{\\lambda}{2} w^\\top \\Sigma w - \\gamma \\lVert w - w_{prev} \\rVert_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5991em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\lVert w - w_{prev} \\rVert_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对偏离当前持仓的调仓量征&quot;税&quot;，天然抑制噪声驱动的频繁换手；以及在回测引擎里用保守的滑点与冲击模型成交，而非假设按收盘价无限量成交。需要警惕的是 2026 年那篇实现风险论文的提醒：同一组权重换一个撮合/成本引擎就可能得出不同盈亏，所以成本假设本身也要被当作可被攻击的假设来做敏感性测试（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2603.20319\">arXiv:2603.20319</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>把回测当统计实验：要分别守住<strong>统计可靠性</strong>（夏普是不是搜出来的）和<strong>实现可靠性</strong>（换引擎加成本还成立吗），两者正交、互不替代（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2603.20319\">arXiv:2603.20319</a>）。</li>\n<li>前视偏差最隐蔽：统计量窗口写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t-w,t]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，坚持<strong>时点数据</strong>；全样本分位数可虚增夏普 15–30%（<a href=\"https://dev.to/tomasz_dobrowolski_35d32c/look-ahead-bias-in-volatility-backtests-why-most-vrp-percentiles-silently-cheat-and-how-to-fix-4jg0\">dev.to</a>）。</li>\n<li>多重试验凭空造夏普：用<strong>去通胀夏普比率 + PBO</strong> 扣回多重测试红利；试得越多，门槛越高（<a href=\"https://www.davidhbailey.com/dhbpapers/deflated-sharpe.pdf\">Deflated SR</a>；<a href=\"https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=2326253\">PBO</a>）。</li>\n<li>验证范式优先<strong>前向验证</strong>与 <strong>CPCV（净化+禁运）</strong>，看前向夏普衰减而非单段峰值（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purged_cross-validation\">CPCV</a>）。</li>\n<li>收尾两关：纳入退市/失败资产消除<strong>幸存者偏差</strong>，并在目标函数与撮合引擎两端建模<strong>交易成本与换手惩罚</strong>，再对成本假设做敏感性测试。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"回测与陷阱：为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象","id":"回测与陷阱-为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把回测当作一次统计实验","id":"核心概念-把回测当作一次统计实验"},{"level":2,"text":"前视偏差：最隐蔽因为它\"看起来很合理\"","id":"前视偏差-最隐蔽因为它-看起来很合理"},{"level":2,"text":"回测过拟合：多重试验如何凭空制造夏普","id":"回测过拟合-多重试验如何凭空制造夏普"},{"level":2,"text":"前向验证：让历史\"按它本来的样子\"展开","id":"前向验证-让历史-按它本来的样子-展开"},{"level":2,"text":"幸存者偏差与成本：把纸面收益拉回地面","id":"幸存者偏差与成本-把纸面收益拉回地面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交易成本与税务：把纸面组合变成真实持仓的摩擦账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/transaction-costs-and-taxes"},"next":null}